{"seq":1,"slug":"difficulty-measures","title":"难度度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/difficulty/difficulty-measures","wordCount":1492,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"难度度量\">难度度量</h1><p>课程学习的成败，九成压在&quot;难度怎么算&quot;这一步——基础章已经点明，难度度量的误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_\\text{bias}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一旦超过优化增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>opt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\text{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，整个课程就由正转负。本篇把基础章里&quot;人类先验/模型状态/训练动态&quot;三种参照系落成可以写进代码的具体度量公式，并给出它们各自的开销、噪声与失效模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个难度度量是一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d:\\ \\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，它给每个样本一个标量分。所有度量按&quot;信号来自哪里&quot;分三族，对应基础章<a href=\"../foundations/difficulty-ordering\">难度排序原理</a>的三种参照系。下表是本篇的总纲：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>族</th>\n<th>代表度量</th>\n<th>计算时机</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>主要失效模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先验型</td>\n<td>句长、推理步数、词频、操作数</td>\n<td>训练前一次</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>人难≠模型难，代理误差大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型型</td>\n<td>即时损失、置信度间隔、预测熵</td>\n<td>训练中在线</td>\n<td>中（每步前向）</td>\n<td>信号带方差，早期模型不可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态型</td>\n<td>遗忘次数、首次学会步数、EL2N/GraNd</td>\n<td>需历史/小段训练</td>\n<td>高（要预跑）</td>\n<td>需代理模型，迁移性存疑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[给样本估难度] --&gt; B[先验型]&#10;  A --&gt; C[模型型]&#10;  A --&gt; D[动态型]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[句长/步数/词频&lt;br/&gt;训练前算好]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[损失/置信度间隔/熵&lt;br/&gt;当前模型前向]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[遗忘频率/EL2N&lt;br/&gt;需代理模型预跑]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E[静态排序&lt;br/&gt;预定义课程]&#10;  C1 --&gt; F[在线门控&lt;br/&gt;自步学习]&#10;  D1 --&gt; G[数据剪枝/&lt;br/&gt;学习潜力]\">flowchart TD\n  A[给样本估难度] --&gt; B[先验型]\n  A --&gt; C[模型型]\n  A --&gt; D[动态型]\n  B --&gt; B1[句长/步数/词频&lt;br/&gt;训练前算好]\n  C --&gt; C1[损失/置信度间隔/熵&lt;br/&gt;当前模型前向]\n  D --&gt; D1[遗忘频率/EL2N&lt;br/&gt;需代理模型预跑]\n  B1 --&gt; E[静态排序&lt;br/&gt;预定义课程]\n  C1 --&gt; F[在线门控&lt;br/&gt;自步学习]\n  D1 --&gt; G[数据剪枝/&lt;br/&gt;学习潜力]</pre><h2 id=\"先验型-人类可读的便宜代理\">先验型：人类可读的便宜代理</h2><p>先验型度量直接读取样本的外在结构，训练前一次算完、永不更新。文本里最常用句子 token 数、平均词频（罕见词多则难）、句法树深度；数学/推理任务用解题步数、最大操作数、变量个数；代码里用圈复杂度、AST 深度。它们的全部价值在于<strong>零在线开销与完全可解释</strong>，适合数据量巨大到无法在线评估难度的场景（如 LLM 预训练）。短板已在基础章说透：它假设人难即模型难，而这个假设的偏差就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_\\text{bias}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。实务上常把多个先验信号线性组合并用验证集校准权重，以压低单一代理的噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型型-让当前模型自报难度\">模型型：让当前模型自报难度</h2><p>模型型度量把&quot;难度是关系&quot;落到实处——用模型此刻对样本的表现定义难度。最直接的是即时损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell(x;\\theta_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：损失越高越难。分类任务更稳的是<strong>置信度间隔</strong>（margin），即最高与次高 logit 之差，间隔小说明模型在边界上挣扎。信息论口径用预测分布的熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(p_\\theta(\\cdot|x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 度量不确定性。2025 年那篇 LLM 课程系统研究把模型型难度细分为五个互补维度——问题难度、模型惊讶度（surprisal）、置信度间隔、预测不确定性、决策可变性——并发现它们各自捕捉到难度的不同侧面，单用任何一个都不完整。</p>\n<p>模型型度量的两个陷阱要牢记。其一，<strong>早期模型不可信</strong>：训练开局参数近乎随机，此时算出的损失/置信度噪声极大，据此排序等于按噪声排序。常见对策是先用一个已收敛的代理模型或较晚的检查点来打分。其二，<strong>自指偏置</strong>：用正在训练的模型给自己的训练样本打分，会形成&quot;模型偏好它已经会的&quot;的正反馈，这正是<a href=\"self-paced-learning\">自步学习</a>需要正则项来对抗的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态型-从训练历史里读难度\">动态型：从训练历史里读难度</h2><p>动态型度量不看某一时刻，而看样本在整段训练里的&quot;行为轨迹&quot;。<strong>遗忘事件</strong>（forgetting events）统计一个样本被学会后又被预测错的次数——从不遗忘的样本简单到可剪枝，频繁遗忘的处在能力边界。<strong>EL2N / GraNd</strong> 分数用训练早期的误差范数或梯度范数预测样本对最终性能的重要性。这些信号需要先用一个代理模型预跑一小段，开销最高，但对数据剪枝特别有效——研究表明可据此安全删掉相当比例的&quot;过易&quot;样本而几乎不损精度，这与<a href=\"../data-centric-ai/synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据中心 AI</a>的剪枝主线直接交汇。它们的软肋是<strong>迁移性</strong>：用一个架构的代理模型算出的难度，未必适用于另一个架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量的校准与噪声-被低估的核心问题\">度量的校准与噪声：被低估的核心问题</h2><p>不同族的难度分量纲不同、分布形状各异，直接比较或线性相加并不合理。实践中先对每族的原始分做秩归一化（rank-normalize）到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再融合。一个简单的融合式是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>rank-norm</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(x) = \\sum_{k} \\alpha_k \\cdot \\text{rank-norm}\\big(d_k(x)\\big), \\qquad \\sum_k \\alpha_k = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank-norm</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应在小规模验证上调，而非凭直觉。更要紧的是评估度量本身的<strong>噪声</strong>：把同一份数据用两个不同种子的代理模型各打一次分，看两套难度排序的 Spearman 相关——相关太低，说明难度信号本身不可靠，此时任何精心设计的调度都是在噪声上雕花。这条诊断常被跳过，却是判断&quot;该不该上课程&quot;的第一道闸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>难度度量分三族：先验型（便宜、可解释、代理误差大）、模型型（贴合本质、带方差、有自指偏置）、动态型（最准但开销高、迁移性存疑）。</li>\n<li>模型型可细分为损失、置信度间隔、熵等五个互补维度，单用一个不完整。</li>\n<li>早期模型打分不可信，常用收敛检查点或代理模型；融合多源度量须先秩归一化再加权，权重靠验证集调。</li>\n<li>上课程前先做噪声诊断：两个种子的难度排序若 Spearman 相关过低，课程多半无益。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"pacing-functions\">调度函数</a> 消费这里算出的难度分、<a href=\"example-weighting\">样本加权</a> 把硬难度变软权重、<a href=\"self-paced-learning\">自步学习</a> 处理模型型度量的自指偏置。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../data-centric-ai/synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据选择与剪枝</a>（动态型难度在剪枝中的应用）、<a href=\"../data-centric-ai/foundations/data-quality\">数据质量</a>（难度与质量的区分）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"难度度量","id":"难度度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"先验型：人类可读的便宜代理","id":"先验型-人类可读的便宜代理"},{"level":2,"text":"模型型：让当前模型自报难度","id":"模型型-让当前模型自报难度"},{"level":2,"text":"动态型：从训练历史里读难度","id":"动态型-从训练历史里读难度"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的校准与噪声：被低估的核心问题","id":"度量的校准与噪声-被低估的核心问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"课程范式谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/curriculum-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"调度函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/difficulty/pacing-functions"}}